EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}You have a room you can't get into
without moving stuff around!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I think I just found your secret
fortress, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Don't worry—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I won't tell anyone where it is!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Eşyaları oynatmadan giremediğin bir oda mı var!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sanırım gizli üssünü buldum,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Merak etme—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kimseye yerini söylemem!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Regardez-moi tout cet espace !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
C'est bien aussi de ne pas trop
encombrer les pièces,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Mann, hast du viel Platz hier drin!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Hier könnte man prima Fangen
spielen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Vaya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Esto está abarrotado!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hasta se podría jugar al escondite
aquí dentro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Oha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bu oda tıklım tıklım!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Saklambaç için mükemmel bir saklanma
yeri olur,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Vaya, vaya...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sí, ya veo lo que
pretendías hacer en este espacio,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
